00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.130 align:start position:0%
call of duty war zones mysterious  bunkers have been locked since launch  but as of the latest update they're  finally opening getting in is tricky  especially for bunker 11 so here's what  you need to know there are 11 numbered  bunkers on the warzone map and we're  gonna start with 1 through 10 luckily  these are all opened in the same way to  get inside you'll need a read access  card which can be obtained from a supply  crate of course there's no guarantee  you'll find one inside a crate as the  access card is a very rare item  alternatively you can get one by killing  a player who picked up a card if you  manage to grab one and you make it to a  bunker alive then you're all set with a  read access card in hand you can get  inside bunkers 1 through 10 the doors  will open up and you'll find a ton of  high tier loot waiting for you inside  bunker 11 is a different story though a  read access card won't help you there  instead bunker 11 has its own puzzle  tied into the phones you've probably  seen across the map most of these will  just have a dial tone but one phone will  have a Russian voice speaking on the  other side you'll need to listen to  determine the 3 numbers the voice is  saying here's a handy translation chart  from reddit user stranger Robin once you  confirm the three numbers your squad  needs to split up and head to the  corresponding numbered phones refer to  our map here for the numbers you'll hear  a Morse code pattern playing to confirm  the number of the phone but if you're  using this map you're already good to go  activate those three phones head to  bunker 11 and you're in bunker Elevens  loot is different from all the others  there are lots of supply crates but  you'll also find the mud dauber  blueprint for the mp7 SMG what's more  you can spot a nuke being assembled this  nuke seems to be hinting at the next  Call of Duty game reportedly titled  black ops cold war that's unconfirmed at  this time but you can learn more about  the rumor on GameSpot  you
 

